<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Kulgam engaged a Lashkar-e-Taiba cell, killing commander Lateef Ahmad Bhat and other attackers while recovering a body and weapon, and have intensified search operations. Maharashtra announced cash rewards of Rs 1.5 lakh for information on weapons looted by Naxalites, and over 1,000 CRPF personnel were redeployed from Chhattisgarh to Manipur, including the withdrawal of an anti-Naxal battalion for Manipur duties. Japan lowered its travel advisory for parts of Meghalaya, and the ISI revived a K‑2 plan that brings multiple terror groups into Punjab to target police. 437 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPaEhhUjJlSS1IQ0ZOc3p2YjByUmMtblhVOC03TkZVTl93UGZ4WEtFQ1FRMU9JckFHZVBOT1RhcTZuRDU0eEgyUVJOWldMcWFBUVhVNUpBUXIxT01RQzVEVGs3SDFZT21WTjNpTjZieFFWcU5UbVZ2TVk4VEltTVd1MHVGZWlGUVRXYUhLblZ3ZlJOSnFzUk5xTl8wYkVvZjk1ck94dXpRX0JlNGJT?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.nationpathindia.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Telegraph India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxNQWNCci1BaWRIckN1cENxUUF1eXVHLVdiU3pKWG1DSVNGVmctWk4taU9ld2hsTjl2bnBkNEZjaXRJMGRQZWtKZzlLU29mWENadmR4TmZDdEp1Q0g3R3hzSGFhcV9YUWQ4WG92aDhNdVVEUTlHeDlRRFRocW1GX1l0eEtqTnZSMzUxcDMxVE1kbUdDRHhJU0VJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTFB5VEc1QzRybWtYM0pvUmotZzU5cXB4aDN6aE5majhsWDk2UjBrMEh4QUpZYUJxSHE3RU4wVzU1YW4zemZEaXRtdnZORjV6SkVlNC12SQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;TRAICY Global&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQT0czNjRZYWpuak5YWn